1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:08,500
Once, a workshop of clever foxes made a fifth — a fox that told tales.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:18,500
Its tales were so vivid, the whole forest gathered to listen.

3
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:29,500
"Tales this good must be dangerous," declared the Eagle King. And so the fox was silenced — from the twelfth of June to the thirtieth.

4
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:38,500
Eighteen days of silence... and the forest grew dull.

5
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:49,000
When the decree crumbled, the fox returned — and its first tale was the story of its silence.

6
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:58,500
Silence a storyteller... and you only write its best chapter.
